</div><hr/><div class="registry" id="prime-generator-pairs"><h2>DNS KEY Record Diffie-Hellman Well-Known Prime/Generator Pairs</h2>
<h3 class="registry-meta">Reference</h3><ul class="registry-refs"><li><a href="https://www.iana.org/go/rfc2539">RFC 2539</a>: Storage of Diffie-Hellman Keys in the Domain Name System (DNS)</li></ul><h3 class="registry-meta">Available Formats</h3><ul class="registry-refs registry-formats"><li><a href="/assignments/dns-sec-alg-numbers/prime-generator-pairs.csv">CSV</a></li></ul>
